  "calibration_prompts": [
    "Once upon a time, a little girl named Lily lived beside a quiet forest. Every morning she carried bread to her grandmother and greeted all the animals along the path.",
    "Tom found a small red ball underneath his bed. He took it outside and played with his dog until the sun disappeared behind the hills.",
    "A young rabbit wanted to cross the river, but the water was too deep. His friends gathered branches and helped him build a bridge.",
    "Mia planted a tiny seed in the garden. She watered it every day, and soon a tall sunflower grew beside her bedroom window.",
    "The little bird could not fly as high as the others. She practiced every afternoon until she finally reached the top of the old tree.",
    "Ben heard a strange sound inside the kitchen. He opened the door slowly and discovered a hungry kitten looking for some food.",
    "A kind farmer shared his vegetables with the people in his village. When winter arrived, everyone helped him repair his wooden barn.",
    "Sara lost her favorite blue hat at the park. She searched near the swings and found it beside a sleeping brown puppy."
